  "project_description": "Library Select \n\n Module allow quick and easy insert CSS/JS code and files to Drupal.\n\nLibrary Select allow you create a field in your content type and Editor can easy select predefined CSS/JS Code.\n\n Configuration \n\nConfiguration URL: admin/config/development/library_select_entity\n\n This module support The CodeMirror Editor integration.\n\n Context \n\nThere is sub module library_select_context integrate with Context module allow you can easy attach library to any page with context rules.\n\n Attach library with Views \n\nYou can use module Views Attach Library and add library to view with format 'library_select/{machine_name}', with {machine_name} is your library select machine_name.\n\n ===========================\n\nThis module borrow some code of module Asset Injector \n\n SUPPORT DEVELOPMENT \n\n \n Buy me a coffee 🥤 \n\n Donation vith Paypal by email: huynhkhacthao@gmail.com",
